---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SITE } from '../site';
---

<Base title="About" description={`About ${SITE.name}: an IT project manager moving into solutions architecture and AI engineering.`}>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="page-head">
      <h1>About</h1>
    </div>
    <div class="article prose">
      <p>
        I'm an IT project manager with about six years of experience running software and implementation projects.
        I'm now finishing an AI engineering course and aiming at solutions architecture: designing how the pieces of a
        system fit together and being able to explain why.
      </p>
      <p>
        I built this site to do that work in the open. Case studies show the shape of a system and the trade-offs
        behind it. Decision records capture a choice while the reasons are still fresh. The build log is the
        day-to-day: what I tried, what broke, what I changed.
      </p>
      <h2>Where to start</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><a href="/build-log/">The build log</a> is the best way to follow along.</li>
        <li><a href="/decisions/">Decision records</a> show how I weigh options.</li>
        <li><a href="/rss.xml">The RSS feed</a> covers all three.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        The source for this site is public on <a href={SITE.repo}>GitHub</a>, so you can see how it's put together.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>
